SVAR - The Voice of Jewellers Daily News:  

Ajoy Chawla Named as Titan’s New Managing Director  

Titan Company Ltd announced today that Mr. C.K. Venkataraman, its MD, will retire on 31 December 2025 upon reaching the Tata Group’s superannuation age  

Mr. C.K. Venkataraman had joined Titan in 1990 & became the MD on 1st October 2019 [...] Titan Company Ltd has appointed Mr. Ajoy Chawla as its next Managing Director, effective 1 January 2026, succeeding Mr. C.K. Venkataraman. Ajoy, currently CEO of Titan’s Jewellery Division, has been pivotal in expanding the business, achieving a 2.5x growth in sales & profits  

The decision relating to Mr. Ajoy’s successor in the Jewellery Division will be taken subsequently  



